# A usage error prints once, on stderr, after the command's help on stdout.
# urfave/cli would print it as "Incorrect Usage: ..." too; lk prints it itself.
! exec lk --bogus room list
stdout '^NAME:'
cmp stderr want-unknown-flag

! exec lk room update --url ws://one.test --api-key APIone --api-secret secretone myroom
stdout '^NAME:'
cmp stderr want-required-flag

requests
! stdout .

-- want-unknown-flag --
flag provided but not defined: -bogus

Did you mean "--subdomain"?
-- want-required-flag --
Required flag "metadata" not set
